1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,137
Five things you must never do in Papua New Guinea.

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:08,145
Don’t take photos of people without asking first. Always ask.

3
00:00:09,195 --> 00:00:11,763
Don’t drink the tap water. Stick to bottled water.

4
00:00:12,813 --> 00:00:17,854
Don’t hop on a PMV minibus in the cities. Travel advisories warn against them.

5
00:00:18,904 --> 00:00:22,658
Don’t hike the Kokoda Track alone. Go with a licensed guide.

6
00:00:23,708 --> 00:00:28,232
And don’t spit betel nut in the streets of Port Moresby. You can get a fine on the spot.
